---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout title="Immigration & Entry" description="Entry support, visa guidance and traveler procedures." sectionEmoji="🛠️" sectionLabel="Citizen & Visitor Services" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true}>
  <p>Use this page to understand the most common entry questions, what to prepare before travel and where to verify the latest rules.</p>

  <h2>Checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Check passport validity early</li>
    <li>Confirm visa / entry requirements</li>
    <li>Print or save booking and accommodation details</li>
    <li>Re-check rules close to departure</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Before you arrive</h2>
  <p>Entry rules can change, so always verify the current procedure before you travel. Keep your passport, travel bookings and any approval emails ready.</p>
<h2>On arrival</h2>
  <p>Plan how you will reach your accommodation from the airport and make sure you know who to contact if a document question comes up.</p>
<h2>Common issues</h2>
  <p>The most common problems are missing paperwork, outdated assumptions and not allowing enough time for checks or follow-up.</p>

  <h2>Next steps</h2>
  <div class="utility-grid">
    <a href="/visit/visa/">Visa guide →</a>
    <a href="/visit/transport/">Transport →</a>
    <a href="/directory/">Directory →</a>
    <a href="/contact/">Contact →</a>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .utility-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .utility-grid a{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:16px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;font-weight:700;display:block}
  @media (max-width: 720px){.utility-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
